// 3. Loop: use AdaptiveConstrainedStep to generate SMILES tokens under parser control
//    - Use SafeRepetitionPenaltyStep to discourage copying exemplar molecules
//    - Stop on EOS or parser completeness
// 4. Close constrained span when complete (appends ">>", costs 1 step)
//
