//   currentConstrainedOut = [] which is valid (precondition: parser.IsValidPrefix([])).
//   In the constrained generation loop, AdaptiveConstrainedStep returns either EOS
//   or a parser-valid next token. AppendConstrainedToken extends currentConstrainedOut
//   by one parser-valid token, preserving parser.IsValidPrefix(currentConstrainedOut).
//   CloseConstrainedSpan sets insideConstrainedOut = false, making the implication
//   vacuous, and clears currentConstrainedOut = [].
//
// progress:
//   OpenConstrainedSpan appends "<<" (1 token to generated) and costs 1 step.
//   Each constrained step costs 1 step and appends at most 1 token to generated.
//   CloseConstrainedSpan appends ">>" (1 token to generated) and costs 1 step.
//   So |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps at all loop iterations.
//   When maxSteps >= 1: OpenConstrainedSpan fires first (costs 1 step),
//   so steps >= 1 after the first branch, giving cost >= 1 > 0.
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_END

