// 6. Set a minimum length before allowing closure (e.g. 4 tokens in constrained prefix).
//
// The critical issue is the parser accepts single atoms as complete SMILES.
// We must discourage early closure by penalizing short-completion tokens.
// Using SafePenalizedConstrainedStep to penalize "O" specifically at the start.
// Also: use GroupBoostedConstrainedStep with validTokenGroups to steer toward
// chain_extender SMILES fragments (C, N, O in chains, not standalone).
// CSD_RATIONALE_END
