//   returns either EOS or a parser-valid extension token. AppendConstrainedToken
//   preserves parser.IsValidPrefix. CloseConstrainedSpan sets insideConstrainedOut
//   := false making the implication vacuous.
// progress:
//   OpenConstrainedSpan costs 1 step before the loop. Each loop iteration
//   increments steps by 1 and appends at most one visible token (EOS is not
//   appended). CloseConstrainedSpan appends ">>" and costs 1 step. So
//   |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps is maintained throughout.
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_END
generated := generatedPrefix;
insideConstrainedOut := insideConstrained;
currentConstrainedOut := currentConstrained;
