//    After the CloseSpanIfComplete no-op path, we keep generating; but if the
//    parser happens to be complete at that point (which can happen), the next
//    AdaptiveConstrainedStep might return a non-EOS token and we'd call
//    AppendConstrainedToken on a complete prefix. Fix: add an explicit
//    IsCompletePrefix guard before calling AppendConstrainedToken, and instead
//    close the span in that case.
