//    if so, close. Then generate one token with AdaptiveConstrainedStep.
//    Before calling AppendConstrainedToken, verify !IsCompletePrefix.
//    On EOS, rollback to complete and close.
// CSD_RATIONALE_END
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_BEGIN
