//   - CloseSpanIfComplete (closed=false): state unchanged, invariant preserved.
//   - CloseConstrainedSpan: sets insideConstrainedOut=false, implication vacuous.
//   - AdaptiveConstrainedStep returns EOS or a parser-valid next token.
//     We guard with !parser.IsCompletePrefix before AppendConstrainedToken,
//     so the precondition is met. AppendConstrainedToken preserves IsValidPrefix.
//   - EOS path: RollbackConstrainedToComplete ensures IsCompletePrefix or [],
