//   - CloseSpanIfComplete (closed=true): appends ">>" (+1), steps+1. Bound holds.
//   - CloseSpanIfComplete (closed=false): no append, steps+1. Bound holds.
//   - AdaptiveConstrainedStep + AppendConstrainedToken: steps+1, generated+1. Holds.
//   - EOS path: RollbackConstrainedToComplete does not add tokens. CloseConstrainedSpan
//     appends ">>" (+1), steps+1. Bound holds.
//   - The maxSteps==0 || cost>0 postcondition: when maxSteps>0, the first branch
